    backlog:areaLocation "03-materials/, one per taught chapter" ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "25 subjects (the 24 chapters of the 3rd edition and multithreading from the 2nd), each with the renewed lecture deck, restyled with PowerPoint's capabilities and rewritten to the edition it rests on" ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product .

