ex:Ev_Review2 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page 9.9.0 from the owner's second review of chapter 5"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Review2/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.9.0 (template 9.9.0, made from 9.8.0 by 08-tooling/template_patch_v9_9_0.py): 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_9_0.py passed all its checks in headless Chromium (54 of 54 widgets and every check of 9.8.0 plus the new ones, no console errors, WCAG 2 AA clean). Choosing a SPARQL sample fills the query at once and the Load sample button is gone; the query then runs. Agent answers are set out as a lead sentence, bullet points with numbered source marks, coloured code words, an example block when an example is asked for, and links to the related concepts; text from a live model is rendered as paragraphs, bullets and code blocks. The question builder was checked over every concept: 111 questions of four kinds (predict the output, name the concept, place it in the taxonomy, pick a kind of) over all 46 concepts, each with distinct options and an in-range answer; New question makes and checks one, One question for every concept made 46 and scored 46 of 46 when answered with the recorded answers, Clear resets, a wrong answer is explained and links to its concept. The generated questions are made from the chapter's data by templates; no model wrote them. A fixture with one stored result altered was refused by three checks. Acceptance @ Courseware: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass; the attestation is pending, not claimed. Stage 4: parse, shapes and sources pass; coverage, substance and hybrid chains fail as on the pages of chapters 3 and 4." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.33.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_9_0.py in headless Chromium on the chapter 5 page; 08-tooling/template_patch_v9_9_0.py regenerates the template from 9.8.0" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T11:18:54"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:Harness_Review2 a backlog:TestHarness ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page 9.9.0 from the owner's second review of chapter 5"@en ;
    backlog:harnessFor ex:ST_Review2_Ch05 ; backlog:harnessComplete true ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence ex:Ev_Review2 .
