    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 13 (Web Scraping), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch13-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6. Reported by the building agent: 12 programs run, all exit 0, two of them live web calls; deck_check re-ran 27 console rows with 0 mismatches; program_check re-ran 11 panels (11 distinct programs) with 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 of 8 diagrams, 88 labels found verbatim, grounding 0.84 or more; layout clean (0 overflows, 0 off-slide shapes); fit 358 frames, 0 overflowing, 0 overlaps; structure_check 0 repairs; links_check 11 links below 400. Five stale fixtures (expr, program, code, transcript capture, diagram) were each refused by the check that targets them, observed in the run. Not verified: no PowerPoint was available, so fit and layout are text-estimate checks and LibreOffice renders of slides 9-24 were viewed only roughly; the live programs and link check depend on the network and can differ on another day. The Reitz photo on slide 10 carries its CC BY 3.0 credit." ;
