ex:Ev_Page_Ch24 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch24"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch24" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page of chapter 24 (Text-to-Speech and Speech Recognition Engines), page 9.35.0 (sen0414_ch24_page_v9_35_0.html) committed in ad398a2: template 9.49.0, builder 4.17.0, NEW test 9.34.0 (the 'no evaluated fetched code' check counted eval( inside the embedded research Turtle, 52 false matches; it now scans the page without the text/turtle blocks and still catches eval, scripted downloads, document.write, base64 decoding and redirects in the page's own code; chapter 23's page gives 0 before and after), register 1.53.0, config 1.19.0, page-data 2.22.0. Reported by the building agent: page test twice in headless Chromium: 372 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped each run (the two ERD label-overlap checks, skipped because the research states no section-to-section relationship). Gates OVERALL PASS; checks script 94 checks 0 mismatches. 0 of 74 examples run in the browser, all 74 'Recorded, not run on this page' with reasons (22 no process start, 44 FileNotFoundError, 7 whisper missing, 1 pyttsx3 missing). 5 hash-checked waveform and cue pictures drawn by the deck's programs from eSpeak NG audio. Deck labels reproduced (NOT EXECUTED slides 5, 8, 12, 19, 23; Recorded 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 11, 12, 15, 18, 19, 20, 23; archive.org audio stands in for YouTube; Whisper medium/turbo memory kills and large-v3 load failure kept as findings). The lineage session did not re-run the page test. OPEN LICENCE QUESTIONS: the book's online materials (not embedded); eSpeak NG is GPL-3.0-or-later and the waveform pictures show its output (agent judges the risk low, not settled). PyPI pages were checked through the JSON API because the HTML pages answer a bot challenge. Not verified: exam release with the real key; live LLM; Chrome and Safari; Windows and macOS; Python 3.14.7+/3.15; a real display or sound card; earlier pages under test 9.34.0; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page committed in ad398a2; research package unchanged at 1.0.2." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py and Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-14T11:16:27"^^xsd:dateTime .
