    backlog:asRole "SEN0414 instructor" ; backlog:wantsCapability "the deck standard and the deck overlap check are measured by new tools, as new files, without moving any existing gate" ; backlog:soThat "the instructor can teach chapters 6, 7 and 8 from decks and pages that meet the written standard, with the slide code runnable in the page in the deck's order" ;
