    backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-23T08:50:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-23T11:42:46"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-24T19:48:08"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid ;
    backlog:hasPriorityScore ex:Score7_ST_Std_DeckTools ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Owner's request of Friday 2026-10-23 08:57 Istanbul (05:57 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator in the assignment to the lineage agent and recorded here as relayed (a statement of its content, not a verbatim quotation, because the lineage agent holds the assignment, not a transcript of the owner's message): the PPT decks and interactive HTML pages of SEN0414 chapters 6 (Lists), 7 (Dictionaries) and 8 must meet the same standards as the sibling course SEN0401 chapters 5 and 6 just delivered, especially that the code on the slides appears exactly, in the same order, in a special 'chapter code' tab of the page that can run it. The request is urgent: the owner's class material is needed as soon as possible, and decks and pages ship chapter by chapter as each is controlled. The request is direction from the owner and authorises the scope; the length of the iteration remains his to decide. Under the standing rule that work following the owner's direction is recorded as owner-directed, it is not listed as an open owner confirmation. One criterion per unit (G133). The Done stories of chapters 6, 7 and 8 (ST_Deck_Ch06, ST_Page_Ch06 in the first lineage; ST_Deck_Ch07, ST_Page_Ch07, ST_Deck_Ch08, ST_Page_Ch08 here) stay Done and are not edited (G125). MEASURED FACTS (the lineage agent, read-only, 2026-10-23; tools: python-pptx 1.0.2 and Playwright 1.56.0; the deck figures come from a straight substitution port of the sibling's deck standard check made in the lineage agent's scratch folder, outside the repository, so the independent tool the first task writes must reproduce or explain every number below; a difference is reported, not adjusted). DECKS. Chapter 6 (03-materials/ch06/SEN0414_Ch06_Lists_3e_v2_0_0.pptx): 26 slides, 12 code slides, 3 native charts, 27 research concepts; elements failing: D1 (25 of 26 slides numbered; the first is not), D2 (longest box 102 words, 17 boxes over 30), D3 (3 of 12 code slides carry both the explanation and a visual result), D4 (12 of 27 key concepts have an analogy), D5 (0 of 4 story slides complete), D7 (25 slides with notes over 60 words, longest 240), D10 (0 of 3 dividers complete), D11 (15 of 27 concepts on a slide = 55.6 percent); D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Chapter 7 (03-materials/ch07/SEN0414_Ch07_Dictionaries_3e_v1_0_0.pptx): 26 slides, 9 code slides, 1 native chart, 34 concepts; D1, D2 (longest 130 words), D3 (0 of 9), D4 (0 of 34), D5 (0 of 4), D7 (longest note 168 words), D11 (17 of 34 = 50.0 percent) fail; D10 not measured (no divider found); D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Chapter 8 (the only deck, 08-tooling/ch08-deck/sen0414_ch08_deck_v1_0_0.pptx; 03-materials/ch08 holds no deck): 25 slides, 13 code slides, 0 native charts, 57 concepts; D1, D2 (longest 90 words), D3 (0 of 13), D4 (0 of 57), D5 (0 of 4), D7 (longest note 140), D11 (31 of 57 = 54.4 percent) fail; D10 not measured; D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Discrepancy to be settled by the independent tool and not adjusted: the owner's own measurement of the chapter 8 deck reported a failure of D8 (resources slide); the port reads D8 PASS (a resources slide, slide 24, with 11 external links). PAGES (the shipped pages sen0414_chNN_page_v9_28_0.html, template line 9.50.0, page test 9.34.0). None of the three pages has a chapter-code tab (0 elements with data-pane chaptercode or data-cc-item), none has a panel level (0 elements with data-panel), none declares the page standard (no meta page-standard); at the first view the page does not scroll sideways at 390 px or at 1366 px (scrollWidth equals clientWidth in both), so the P1 overflow measure is not among the findings of this reading; the other page measures (P2 to P11) are taken by the page test the second task writes. TOOLS. The SEN0414 line has the template 9.50.0 (course_page_template_v9_50_0.html), the page builder v4_17_0, the page-data builder v2_24_0 and the page test 9.34.0 (with the exam-release checks, run by sen0414_page_test_run_v1_0_0.py against a TEST release key); it has no deck standard check, no deck overlap check and no chapter-code tab. The sibling course SEN0401 holds the finished versions of all of these (deck standard check v1_0_0, deck overlap check v1_0_0, page test 9.36.0, template 9.52.1, page builder v4_15_0, page-data builder v2_24_0), from the same ancestry as this line; they are ported as new-named copies, never edited. The chapter check v1_1_0 of this register reads the build checks of chapters 7 to 12 (chapter 6 has no entry in it)." .

