    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 8 + time criticality 20 + risk reduction 20) / job size 1.0 h = 48.00. Re-scored on Friday 2026-10-23 11:07 Istanbul (08:07 UTC) under the owner's standing instruction that repairs re-rank the open work. Inputs from observable facts: job size is the sum of the story's task estimates in this register; time criticality 20 = the class of 2026-10-23 or work that blocks it, 13 = blocks later work, 8 = later in the chapter order; the repair: a defect that every page built from the template ships (3 pages in this iteration, measured byte 15897 against a limit of 1024); it blocks 3 page stories (dependsOn) and is cheapest now, while the template and page-test tasks are being written. The previous state was 'not scored' (a direct owner order); this record replaces that flag and ranks the starts." .
