    backlog:hasFixtureState "The committed template 9.52.1 (description comment closing at byte 1157) and the committed runner v1_0_0." .

ex:AC2R_TemplateFix a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The repaired template 9.52.2 shows no text before the header and the old and new page tests end with no failed feature"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed repair (ex:CR2_Repair2). Given the template 9.52.1 (its description comment closes early at byte 1157), the page builder v4_18_0 and the page test 9.36.0, when the NEW files course_page_template_v9_52_2.html and sen0414_page_build_v4_18_1.py are made, then ALL of: (1) the files are new and 9.52.1 and v4_18_0 are byte-identical; (2) in the new template every comment is balanced (the count of '<!--' equals the count of '-->' and no '-->' lies inside a comment), the declaration <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> is still the first child of head below byte 512, and every id and hook of 9.52.1 is kept; (3) a page built on it has no visible text between <body> and the header (the header starts at 0 px at 1400x900); the builder v4_18_1 refuses a template that breaks (2) or a built page that breaks this; (4) scratch pages of chapters 1 and 10 built on 9.52.2 run through the page test 9.36.0 and 9.34.0 end exit 0 with no failed feature, including 'a focused concept starts at the top' and 'small phone (360px)', and widgets, features and gates not below the stored result of the shipped page; (5) the report states why the executor's earlier log of template 9.52.1 showed both features passing; (6) no committed file is edited; results as printed, measured by the controller from the files and by its own page-test runs." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_PageTemplate, ex:TS2_PageBuilder, ex:TS2_PageTest36, ex:TS2_PageTest34 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "deck standard check v1_0_0 (python-pptx 1.0.2); deck overlap check v1_0_0; page test 9.36.0 (Playwright 1.56.0, new file over 9.34.0: every feature of 9.34.0 unchanged, the page-standard features added); page test 9.34.0; page template 9.52.1 (new file over 9.50.0); page builder v4_18_0 and page-data builder v2_25_0 (new files over v4_17_0 and v2_24_0); chapter check v1_1_0 of this register; RDODI gates v1_1_1; Playwright 1.56.0; page test 9.36.0 and 9.34.0 (Playwright 1.56.0); page template 9.52.2 and builder 4.18.1 (new files over 9.52.1 and 4.18.0); runner 1.1.0 (new file over 1.0.0)" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2R_Passes, ex:TC2R_NotClaimed .

ex:AC2R_Runner a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The new runner runs the page test 9.36.0 and ends non-zero on the measured defects of the shipped page"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed repair (ex:CR2_Repair2). Given the runner sen0414_page_test_run_v1_0_0.py (names the page test 9.34.0), when the NEW file sen0414_page_test_run_v1_1_0.py is made, then ALL of: (1) the file is new and v1_0_0 is byte-identical; (2) by default it runs the page test 9.36.0 (the environment PAGE_TEST_FILE can name another test file, for example 9.34.0), keeps the interface of v1_0_0 (NN and PAGEVER, the key-substituted copy, the TEST key, output outside the repository, exit 0 only when the test exits 0, every widget passes and no [FAIL] line), and also accepts the environment FORCE_STANDARD and a page file outside the repository (PAGE_FILE); (3) run on the shipped page of chapter 8 v9_28_0 with FORCE_STANDARD=1 it prints the P features and ends non-zero on the measured defects (P11, P12 at byte 9293, the chapter-code P2), and run on a scratch page built from the repaired template it prints the P features passing; (4) no committed file is edited; results as printed, re-run by the controller." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_PageTemplate, ex:TS2_PageBuilder, ex:TS2_PageTest36, ex:TS2_PageTest34 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "deck standard check v1_0_0 (python-pptx 1.0.2); deck overlap check v1_0_0; page test 9.36.0 (Playwright 1.56.0, new file over 9.34.0: every feature of 9.34.0 unchanged, the page-standard features added); page test 9.34.0; page template 9.52.1 (new file over 9.50.0); page builder v4_18_0 and page-data builder v2_25_0 (new files over v4_17_0 and v2_24_0); chapter check v1_1_0 of this register; RDODI gates v1_1_1; Playwright 1.56.0; page test 9.36.0 and 9.34.0 (Playwright 1.56.0); page template 9.52.2 and builder 4.18.1 (new files over 9.52.1 and 4.18.0); runner 1.1.0 (new file over 1.0.0)" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2R_Passes, ex:TC2R_NotClaimed .

