    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch09_Build, ex:TK_Std_DeckCheck ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Run the deck standard check v1_0_0 and the deck overlap check v1_0_0 for chapter 9, the chapter's own build checks (the chapter check v1_1_0 where it covers the chapter), and read the deck slide by slide, rendering every slide to an image for visual review (the reading by the three roles of the owner's preference - teaching academician, reviewing faculty specialist, student - is recorded as a reading, not as a tool result); record every result as printed: Done or NOT MET, no waiver. Planned session SEN0414-lineage (control); estimated start T0+5h after the executors begin, about 0.5 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun)." .

