    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 20 + time criticality 20 + risk reduction 13) / job size 5.5 h = 9.64. Re-scored on 2026-10-23T14:25:54 UTC after the owner decision of Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul (13:06 UTC) (ex:CR2_Priority3). Ranking after the owner decision (WSJF, inputs from observable facts): the repairs still rank first (a repair outranks the work it blocks); then the chapter 7, 8 and 9 pages (time criticality 20: next week), the chapter 9 deck first because the chapter 9 page depends on it; the chapter 6 page drops to time criticality 8. The deck of chapter 9 is a prerequisite and starts at once, in parallel with the repairs, although its own score is below the pages' (a dependency orders starts before a score does). Inputs from observable facts: job size is the sum of the story's task estimates in this register; time criticality 20 = next week's class or work that blocks it, 13 = blocks later work, 8 = later in the order. chapter 9 is urgent for next week by the owner decision: time criticality 20; risk reduction 13 because the chapter 9 page depends on this deck. The earlier record is kept as history." .
