ex:Iter_19 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 19: the chapter 1 to 5 decks, pages and research sets brought to the written standard"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_19" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-25T01:37:12"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-11-01T01:37:12"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the lineage agent on 2026-10-25T01:37:12: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC2_Iter_19; the length is 7 days, constant (G9) - a stipulation, not a measurement (the class cadence). Justification of the work inside it (estimates, G120): 14.5 h per chapter (Deck_Build 5.0 h, Deck_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Build 3.5 h, Research 4.0 h, Research_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Verify 1.0 h), 72.5 h for chapters 1 to 5; the heavy part is the browser tests, serial on the two cores; decks and research sets of different chapters may be built side by side. This is NOT a promise that all five chapters finish inside the seven days (gap d of ex:IA2_Iter19); chapter 1 first, and each chapter ships as soon as it is controlled." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The decks, the chapter-code manifests and the interactive pages of chapters 1 to 5 are rebuilt as new files that meet the written teaching-material standard (the deck standard D1 to D12, measured by the independent deck check and overlap check; the page standard P1 to P11, measured by the page test 9.37.0 and 9.34.0), the research set and the page ABox of each chapter pass the chapter check Research/ChNN on the new page, the slide code of each chapter appears in the same order in the chapter-code tab of its page and runs there, chapter 1 first, then 2, 3, 4 and 5; every file is verified by the lineage agent's own re-runs on the evidence bridge. Each unit that fails is named failing and is not Done. No existing file, gate, test or threshold is edited. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch01, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch02, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch03, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch04, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch05, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Page_Verify .

ex:AC2F_Retrofit a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "A retrofitted chapter has a deck that meets the deck standard, its chapter-code manifest and a page that meets the page standard"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Planned into Iteration 19 (ex:CR2_Iter19). Given the old deck and old page of the chapter and its research, when the deck is rebuilt as a new file (deck standard check and overlap check pass, every element D1 to D12), the chapter-code manifest written from the deck, and the page rebuilt as a new file on the repaired template (page test 9.37.0 passes, the chapter-code tab equal to the manifest), then the chapter is retrofitted; the controller re-runs every check (the deck standard check, the deck overlap check, the page test 9.37.0 and 9.34.0 under the runner v1_1_0; the chapter check covers Research only for chapters 1 to 5); the chapter-code manifest 03-materials/chNN/page/chapter_code_chNN_v1_0_0.json equals the deck's code boxes (text and order); the research set is the criterion ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch; no committed file is edited." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_DeckStdCheck, ex:TS2_DeckOverlap, ex:TS2_PageTest37 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "deck standard check v1_0_0; deck overlap check v1_0_0; page test 9.37.0 through runner v1_1_0; template 9.52.2; builder 4.18.1; the versions then current when the chapter is planned into an iteration" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2S_D_Passes, ex:TC2S_D_NotClaimed .

