    backlog:hasPriorityScore ex:Score29_ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch01 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "OWNER DECISION of Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul (13:06 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator and recorded as relayed (content, not a verbatim quotation), a priority input: SEN0414 chapters 7, 8 and 9 are urgent for next week; chapter 6 drops behind them. After they are finished, return to ALL chapters starting with chapter 1 (retrofit to the standard: deck, chapter-code manifest, page), and after that build all remaining chapters. The coordinator's direction: add chapter 9 (deck, manifest, page) to Iter_18; check what exists for chapter 9; re-rank dated (chapters 7, 8, 9 deck and page ahead of the chapter 6 page, the repairs still first); plan the follow-on as planned work with estimates, not started now. The owner's standing rule that repairs re-rank the open items also holds. Estimate: deck rebuild 5.0 h, page rebuild 4.0 h (executor sessions), control 1.0 h (controller): 10.0 h; order: chapters 1 to 5, then 10 to 25, each after the chapters 7, 8 and 9 are finished. PLANNED, NOT STARTED: no task is made, no score is given and no work begins until the chapter is planned into an iteration and released." .

