ex:ST_Plan_Remaining a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Build all remaining chapters to the standard (planned)"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "ST_Plan_Remaining" ;
    backlog:hasTitle "Build all remaining chapters to the standard (planned)" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:memberOfContainer ex:Iter_20 ; backlog:responsible ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession ; backlog:admittedByOutput ex:Out2_BacklogR11 ;
    backlog:hasInvestmentCategory backlog:Cat_NewCapability ;
    backlog:asRole "SEN0414 instructor" ; backlog:wantsCapability "every remaining chapter of the course built as research, deck, chapter-code manifest and page that meet the written standard" ; backlog:soThat "no chapter of the course is left outside the standard" ;
    backlog:satisfiesDeliverable ex:Del2_StdDecks, ex:Del2_StdPages ; backlog:pursuesObjective ex:Obj2_StdDecks, ex:Obj2_StdPages ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC2F_Retrofit ;
    backlog:effectiveDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD ; backlog:hasApplicableConcern backlog:Concern_Data ;
    backlog:hasState backlog:Cancelled ; backlog:hasRationale "Withdrawn on 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC by the change route ex:CR2_Iter20: the story waited for a measurement ('the list of chapters still lacking research, deck or page is measured when the retrofits finish'). Measured 2026-10-25: the repository holds research files (03-materials/chNN/rdodi), a deck (03-materials/chNN or 08-tooling/chNN-deck) and a page (03-materials/chNN/page) for each of the 25 chapters of the course (the 3rd edition's 24 chapters and the threads chapter 25 of the 2nd edition); no chapter lacks one of the three, so there is nothing to build from scratch. The standard-conformance of chapters 10 to 25 is the work of the 16 retrofit stories. If a chapter outside these 25 is named, or one is found lacking, a new story is made by the change route. Not a waiver: the work the story named is measured empty." ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Scored when its own iteration is planned." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "OWNER DECISION of Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul (13:06 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator and recorded as relayed (content, not a verbatim quotation), a priority input: SEN0414 chapters 7, 8 and 9 are urgent for next week; chapter 6 drops behind them. After they are finished, return to ALL chapters starting with chapter 1 (retrofit to the standard: deck, chapter-code manifest, page), and after that build all remaining chapters. The coordinator's direction: add chapter 9 (deck, manifest, page) to Iter_18; check what exists for chapter 9; re-rank dated (chapters 7, 8, 9 deck and page ahead of the chapter 6 page, the repairs still first); plan the follow-on as planned work with estimates, not started now. The owner's standing rule that repairs re-rank the open items also holds. Estimate: about 12.0 h per chapter built from scratch (research 3.0 h, deck 5.0 h, page 4.0 h) plus 1.0 h of control; the list of chapters still lacking research, deck or page is measured when the retrofits finish. PLANNED, NOT STARTED." .
