    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Controller task (the lineage agent): re-run the diff of 9.37.0 against 9.36.0 and require exactly the three changes; run the page tests 9.37.0 and 9.34.0 through the runner v1_1_0 on the pages of chapters 6, 7 and 8, one at a time under the shared lock, with the controller's own logs; require no failed feature; re-run the four fixtures (text-only fails, real crash fails, slow visual passes, expected error passes); check that 9.36.0 and 9.34.0 are byte-identical; run the evidence bridge and record the result, Done or NOT MET, no waiver. Planned session the lineage agent; estimated start after the page test after the executors begin, about 0.75 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun)." .
