ex:TK_Std_ResearchCh06 backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-24T21:28:25 UTC (ex:CR2_ResFix06B): SUPERSEDES the instructions above (ex:CR2_ResFix06B): the first session stopped without changes by its stop condition and found that the gate findings are measured on the chapter 6 PAGE ABox, which a research file cannot move. The task is widened (option A) and is done by a new session on the same task. Do BOTH: (A) the research v2_1_0 set: write the NEW data module 08-tooling/sen0414_ch06_rdodi_data_v2_1_0.py from v2_0_0 with TAX and BODY from the chapter corpus 08-tooling/sen0414_ch06_corpus_v1_0_0.py (the way chapter 7 v1_3_0 and chapter 8 v1_0_2 did) and build the five files v2_1_0 into 03-materials/ch06/rdodi with the generic builder 08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_build_v1_2_0.py, so that the execution checks have 0 mismatches; (B) the page ABox: write the NEW builder 08-tooling/sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_9.py from v1_1_8 (read it first and say what you changed) and build the NEW 03-materials/ch06/page/sen0414_ch06_page_abox_v1_4_0.ttl so that it describes the NEW page sen0414_ch06_page_v9_90_0.html (read the page, its page data and the manifest); give the 11 hollow individuals (CO1-CO5, Layout, Header, Sidebar, Main, GroupedTopBar, SectionTree) a skos:definition and a dcterms:source, and every s_*, w_*, wv_* and structural individual a content text of at least five words, taken from the page's own text and the book, nothing invented. Find the root cause of each finding before editing; fix them in the data and the builder, never in a gate or a check. Verify with python3 08-tooling/sen0414_lineage_chapter_check_v1_1_0.py Research/Ch06 (must end PASS), and Research/Ch07, Research/Ch08, Research/Ch09, Page/Ch06 (must still end PASS), keeping every log in 08-tooling/ch06-research/logs_iter18/. Do not touch the deck, the page, its manifest or any committed file. Run the Java reasoner one run at a time (2 shared cores). Commit and push each verified step. Report the commit SHAs, the new files and the verbatim output of every check; say what failed if anything." .
ex:TK_Std_ResearchCh06_Verify backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-24T21:28:25 UTC (ex:CR2_ResFix06B): Controller task, restated (ex:CR2_ResFix06B): require every committed file byte-identical (v2_0_0 and v1_0_0 research files, page ABox v1_3_0, the page v9_90_0, the deck, the manifest, the older builders); re-run the chapter checks Research/Ch06 (must PASS with Stage 4 on the NEW page ABox), Research/Ch07, Research/Ch08, Research/Ch09 and Page/Ch06 on the controller's own runs; diff the concept names of v2_0_0 and v2_1_0; check that the new page ABox describes the new page (its tabs, panels, widgets and 25-example-class chapter code against the page and the manifest); run the evidence bridge and record the result, Done or NOT MET, no waiver." .
ex:ST_Std_ResearchCh06 backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-24T21:28:25 UTC (ex:CR2_ResFix06B): the story's job size is 6.0 h and its criterion covers the page ABox of chapter 6. The first executor session on the task stopped without changes by its stop condition and reported the cause; it is not a failure of the work. MEASURED FACTS (the executor's report; the lineage agent read the gates script and the files on 2026-10-24): the gates script 08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py runs its Stage 4 on the newest 03-materials/chNN/page/sen0414_chNN_page_abox_v*.ttl when one exists (line 20), and skips Stage 4 when none exists. Chapter 6 has such a page ABox (sen0414_ch06_page_abox_v1_3_0.ttl, committed 0097aae, 2026-09-30, built by sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_7/8); chapters 7, 8 and 9 have none, which is why their Research checks pass. The findings of the executor's run: Stage4.cov 'hollow instantiation: 11 typed individuals lack label+content' = CO1-CO5, Layout, Header, Sidebar, Main, GroupedTopBar, SectionTree (a label but no skos:definition or dcterms:source); Stage4.sub '152 individuals not substantive' = page individuals s_* (58), w_* (57), wv_* (24) and structural ones, each with fewer than five words of content. A research v2_1_0 cannot move these gates. The 2 execution-check mismatches (17 classes missing from the TBox, 11 individuals missing from the ABox) come from the old data module sen0414_ch06_rdodi_data_v2_0_0.py (it carries the old v1_0_0 TAX/BODY); chapter 7 v1_3_0 fixed the same kind of drift by taking TAX/BODY from the chapter corpus (sen0414_ch06_corpus_v1_0_0.py). The page ABox of v1_3_0 describes the OLD page (v9_28_0 line); the page of chapter 6 is now v9_90_0 on template 9.52.2, so the NEW page ABox must describe the new page. Chapter 9: the page of chapter 9 v9_90_0 has no page ABox, Stage 4 is skipped and Research/Ch09 passes; it has the same exposure only if a page ABox is ever added for it, which is not planned. The finding is a gap of the chapter 6 research set (research files plus the page ABox) that predates iteration 18; it belongs to element (4) of the chapter 6 page criterion; it is repaired, not waived." .
