ex:AC2R_ResearchCh06 backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-24T22:48:02 UTC (ex:CR2_ResFix06C, StageRevision Revision_Lineage2_Backlog8): element (3) no longer says Cross.B passing: Cross.B must not FAIL and its CANNOT_RUN (0 hybrid chains) is reported openly and is not counted as a pass; the gap is tracked by the planned story ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB. Every other element is as before. MEASURED FACTS (executor logs 08-tooling/ch06-research/logs_iter18/gates_ch06_partA_run1.log, gates_ch06_partA_run2.log, gates_ch06_partB_run1.log, chapter_check_Research_Ch06_run1.log, and the controller's own run of the chapter check Research/Ch06 on 2026-10-25): the gates end 'OVERALL: PASS' and print '[CANNOT_RUN ] Cross.B: hybrid chains: 0 checked, 0 broken'; Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src PASS on the new page ABox v1_4_0. Cross.B is evaluated only inside Stage 4, that is only for a chapter that has a page ABox; no chapter had one passing it before (chapters 7 to 9 have none, chapter 6's v1_3_0 failed Stage 4 on other checks), so the check has never produced a measured result in this course. It reports CANNOT_RUN because no hybrid chain (a chain that crosses the research document, the domain ontology and the page ABox) exists in any chapter's files for it to check; building such chains is work on the research design of the course, outside the repair of the findings of ex:CR2_ResFix06 and ex:CR2_ResFix06B. The criterion text this register wrote ('Cross.B passing') is therefore unsatisfiable by the task as it stands; the executor did not fake it and reported it openly." .
