ex:RC2_Iter_18B a backlog:SprintReviewCeremony ; rdfs:label "Review of iteration 18: the remaining stories closed and the iteration closed"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_18 ; backlog:reviewsCeremony ex:PC2_Iter_18 ; backlog:closesIteration ex:Iter_18 ;
    backlog:closesStory ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch09, ex:ST_Std_PageTest37, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch06, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch09, ex:ST_Std_ResearchCh06 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-25T01:12:14"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Held 2026-10-25T01:12:14 UTC by the lineage agent, on the controlled work of the iteration: ST_Std_Deck_Ch09, ST_Std_PageTest37, ST_Std_Page_Ch06, ST_Std_Page_Ch09, ST_Std_ResearchCh06 are closed, each with all its tasks Done on bridge-verified evidence (register 2.198.0 and 2.200.0). Every member of the iteration is now Done, so the iteration is closed; nothing is carried over. The end of the iteration stays at its proposed end, 2026-10-30T06:59:32 UTC: moving it is a rebaseline, which is an owner decision, and none has been made; the closing instant is this ceremony's heldAt. The first review (ex:RC2_Iter_18) closed the earlier stories. The readings of the two objectives are the observations taken at this review. Findings carried to the next iteration as planned work, not as open members: Cross.B of the research gates cannot run (planned story ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB); the story photograph of the chapter 9 page fills the viewport height (to be handled in the retrofit of the pages)."@en .
