ex:Score16_ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch01 a backlog:PriorityScore ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_WSJF ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "3.45"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T01:37:12"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 20 + time criticality 20 + risk reduction 10) / job size 14.5 h = 3.45. Inputs from observable facts: job size is the sum of the story's task estimates in this register (Deck_Build 5.0 h, Deck_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Build 3.5 h, Research 4.0 h, Research_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Verify 1.0 h); time criticality 20 = place 1 in the owner's order of chapters (20 = first, then 16, 13, 10, 8); risk reduction 10 = the deck-standard elements (8) and research gates (2) measured failing on 2026-10-25 UTC. Scored on 2026-10-25T01:37:12 UTC at the planning of Iteration 19 (ex:CR2_Iter19); the earlier planned-and-unscored state is history." .
ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch01 backlog:hasAuditNote "PLANNED INTO ITERATION 19 on 2026-10-25T01:37:12 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter19, planning ceremony ex:PC2_Iter_19): Ready, scored, decomposed into six tasks (deck build, deck verify, page build, research set and page ABox, research verify, page verify). CHAPTER 1 (Python Basics) as it stands: research 03-materials/ch01/rdodi (document v1_2_0, domain TBox v1_1_1, ABox v1_1_1, SHACL v1_0_1, research v1_1_0; there is NO data module for chapter 1 in 08-tooling, only the corpus sen0414_ch01_corpus_v1_2_0.py: write the data module like chapter 7 v1_3_0 from the corpus); newest deck 03-materials/ch01/SEN0414_Ch01_PythonBasics_3e_v3_0_0.pptx (builder deck_build_v3_0_0.py in 08-tooling/ch01-deck/); newest page 03-materials/ch01/page/sen0414_ch01_page_v9_28_0.html with page ABox v9_4_2; stories 08-tooling/sen0414_ch01_stories_v1_0_0.py; the first-program example of the old deck is 08-tooling/ch01-deck/first_program_v1_0_1.py. GAPS SAID OPENLY: (a) the metrics Met2_StdDecks and Met2_StdPages count the decks and pages of chapters 6, 7 and 8 (target 3) and read 3 and 3 at the Iter_18 review; the retrofit of chapters 1 to 5 moves no number of those metrics, and a metric for it has not been defined: defining one is a change of the Objective stage, held back for the owner's decision on the objective; until then the Iter_19 review reports the chapters retrofitted as an observation of the existing objectives with the method text stating what was counted. (b) Cross.B of the research gates still cannot run (ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB); the research criterion of the retrofit therefore says: Cross.B must not FAIL, CANNOT_RUN is reported and is not a pass. (c) The chapter check of this register does not cover Deck and Page of chapters 1 to 5 (fact 3). (d) The end of Iter_19 is the proposed end of seven days (G9); a rebaseline is an owner decision, and 72.5 h of estimated work in seven days depends on how many executor sessions run side by side (the plan: decks and research of different chapters in parallel, browser tests serially); the plan does not promise that all five chapters finish inside it, and a chapter that is not Done at the review is said to be not Done and is carried by the change route, not hidden. No executor has started; work begun is recorded at the real start of each executor session." .

ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Build a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Rebuild the deck of chapter 2 (Flow Control) against the deck standard and give it its chapter-code manifest"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Build" ; backlog:hasTitle "Rebuild the deck of chapter 2 (Flow Control) against the deck standard and give it its chapter-code manifest" ;
