    backlog:hasAuditNote "Make the research set of chapter 4 (Functions) pass the chapter check Research/Ch04 on a NEW data version and a NEW page ABox that describes the NEW page. Read the criterion (ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch) and the precedent of chapter 6 first (commits 0064873, 12b4bd1, f18e3da, 86d4946, c1d3615; the data module 08-tooling/sen0414_ch06_rdodi_data_v2_2_0.py; the page-ABox builder 08-tooling/sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_9.py; the chapter 7 data module v1_3_0 for the way a data module is made from a corpus). The lesson of chapter 6: a second session dropped seven individuals of the old set and said nothing was removed; before you report, compare the sets of individuals, classes, links, sources and labels of the OLD and the NEW files with a script and list every difference with its reason. Nothing is invented: content comes from the book's chapter, the deck, the page and the existing files. A committed file is never edited. STOP and report if the task cannot be satisfied without editing a committed file, a gate, a test or a threshold beyond the named new files. Report every result as printed (PASS, FAIL, NOT_MEASURED, CANNOT_RUN); Cross.B CANNOT_RUN is reported as such and is not a pass. The machine has 2 cores: no build beside a browser test. Planned session SEN0414-I19-research-ch04; estimated 4.0 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun). Starts when the page of the chapter is controlled (the page ABox describes the new page); the research set itself may be prepared earlier but its page ABox is built last." .
