ex:Iter_20 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 20: the chapter 10 to 25 decks, pages and research sets brought to the written standard, and the Cross.B pilot"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_20" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-25T09:46:42"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-11-01T09:46:42"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the lineage agent on 2026-10-25T09:46:42: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC2_Iter_20; the length is 7 days, constant (G9) - a stipulation, not a measurement (the class cadence). Justification of the work inside it (estimates, G120): 14.5 h per chapter (Deck_Build 5.0 h, Deck_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Build 3.5 h, Research 4.0 h, Research_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Verify 1.0 h), 232 h for chapters 10 to 25, and 8.5 h for the Cross.B pilot; the heavy part is the browser tests, serial on the two cores, with at most three executors at once. This is NOT a promise that all sixteen chapters finish inside the seven days (gap d of ex:IA2_Iter20); chapter 10 first, and each chapter ships as soon as it is controlled." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The decks, the chapter-code manifests and the interactive pages of chapters 10 to 25 are rebuilt as new files that meet the written teaching-material standard (the deck standard D1 to D12, measured by the independent deck check and overlap check; the page standard P1 to P11, measured by the page test 9.37.0 and 9.34.0, with the story-layout rule on every story), the research set and the page ABox of each chapter pass the chapter check Research/ChNN on the new page (the first page ABox of each of these chapters), the slide code of each chapter appears in the same order in the chapter-code tab of its page and runs there, in the owner's order of chapters, 10 first; Cross.B is made measurable in a pilot chapter; every file is verified by the lineage agent's own re-runs on the evidence bridge. Each unit that fails is named failing and is not Done. No existing file, gate, test or threshold is edited. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Plan_Remaining, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch10, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch11, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch12, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch12_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch13, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch13_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch14, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch14_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch15, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch16, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch16_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch17, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch17_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch18, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch18_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch19, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch19_Page_Verify, ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch20, 