ex:AC2F_Retrofit backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-25T01:37:12 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter19): the criterion is planned into Iteration 19 for chapters 1 to 5; it names how the controller measures them (the chapter check covers Research only for these chapters, fact 3 of ex:IA2_Iter19) and states the manifest element; the research set is a criterion of its own, ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch. For chapters 10 to 25 and the remaining chapters it stays planned and is restated again when they are planned." .

ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The research set and the page ABox of a retrofitted chapter pass the chapter check Research on a new data version and the new page"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given the research set and the page ABox of chapter N as they stand (the chapter check Research/ChNN ends 'OVERALL: FAIL (2)': Stage4.cov and Stage4.sub fail on the page ABox) and the NEW page of the chapter (the page-build task of the same chapter, Done and controlled), when (A) a NEW data module 08-tooling/sen0414_chNN_rdodi_data_vX_Y_Z.py is written from the chapter corpus and the existing research files (no individual, class, link or source of the old files is dropped without a stated reason; nothing is invented) and the chapter files are rebuilt from it by the generic builder (sen0414_rdodi_build_v1_2_0.py) as NEW versioned files in 03-materials/chNN/rdodi, and (B) a NEW page-ABox builder version file where needed (the newest is sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_9.py; older versions stay) builds a NEW page ABox 03-materials/chNN/page/sen0414_chNN_page_abox_vX_Y_Z.ttl that describes the NEW page (its menus, tabs, panels, widgets and chapter-code examples as they are in that page), then ALL of: (1) every new file is new and every committed file (the older research files, page ABoxes, the deck, the page, the manifest, the builders) is byte-identical; (2) every typed individual of the new research ABox and of the new page ABox has a label, a definition and a source where the gates ask for them, and content of at least five words that is substantive by the gate, written from the book's chapter, the deck, the page and the existing content; the set of individuals, classes, links and sources of the old files is a subset of the new files' or each missing one has a stated reason (the controller compares the sets); (3) the chapter check Research/ChNN ends exit 0 with 'RESULT Research/ChNN: PASS': the gates 'OVERALL: PASS' with Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src passing on the NEW page ABox, HermiT consistent, the execution checks with 0 mismatches; Cross.B must not FAIL; it reports CANNOT_RUN (0 hybrid chains) and is reported openly as such and NOT counted as a pass (tracked by the planned story ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB); (4) the deck, the page and the manifest of the chapter are not changed (the page file keeps its SHA-256) and the page test 9.37.0 still ends exit 0 on the page; (5) the chapter checks Research/Ch06 to Research/Ch09 and the Research checks of the chapters retrofitted before still end PASS; no committed file is edited; results as printed, measured by the controller by its own re-runs." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_RdodiGates, ex:TS2_ChapterCheck, ex:TS2_PageAboxBuild ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "chapter check v1_1_0; RDODI gates v1_1_1; RDODI checks v1_2_0; generic builder v1_2_0; page-ABox builder v1_1_9 (or a newer new-file version); the page test 9.37.0; Python 3.14, HermiT" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2R6_Passes, ex:TC2R6_NotClaimed, ex:TC2R6B_PageAbox .
ex:Excl2_NoRebuild rdfs:comment "Lifted on 2026-10-25T01:37:12 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter19) for chapters 1 to 5, ONLY for the NEW files of their decks, chapter-code manifests, pages, research sets, data modules and page ABoxes (the retrofit of Iteration 19): no existing deck, research run, page or page ABox of these chapters is changed. Chapters 10 to 25 and the remaining chapters stay excluded; each is lifted by its own record when it is planned into an iteration."@en .
ex:SC2_Iter19 a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Thirty tasks and one criterion admitted for the retrofit of chapters 1 to 5 in Iter_19; the later chapters move to Iter_20"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR2_Iter19 ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope2 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch02_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch03_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch04_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Page_Verify ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Direction of the course coordinator, 2026-10-25, recorded as relayed: close the Iteration 18 review, then plan and start the Iteration 19 retrofit from chapter 1 by the change route: re-rank the open items, generate the briefs, give the executor briefs to start; do not wait for the owner. The owner's decision of Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul (13:06 UTC) (ex:CR2_Priority3), recorded as relayed, is the release: after chapters 7, 8 and 9 are finished, return to ALL chapters starting with chapter 1 (retrofit to the standard: deck, chapter-code manifest, page). Chapters 7, 8 and 9 and the repairs are finished and controlled (register 2.201.0). The boundary does not move outward in deliverables; the stories were admitted by the owner's decision, these are their tasks." .
ex:CR2_Iter19 rdfs:comment "Disposition set to Accepted on 2026-10-25 in the version that records the ScopeChange ex:SC2_Iter19; it was Pending before. The release is the owner's decision of 2026-10-23 (ex:CR2_Priority3) and the coordinator's direction; the owner is not waited for."@en .

