ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "FINDING of the control of the chapter 1 deck (2026-10-25): the corpus 08-tooling/sen0414_ch01_corpus_v1_2_0.py and the document 03-materials/ch01/rdodi/sen0414_ch01_document_v1_2_0.ttl carry the branches ExecutionEnvironment (InteractiveEnvironment, PythonImplementation, InterpreterBuild, PythonRelease) and ModernPractice (StringFormatting, Tooling) that the domain ABox v1_1_1 and the research v1_1_0 do not contain (0 mentions). The deck dropped the old CPython, GIL, version, thread and free-book slides and the PEP 703 story as outside the 19 research concepts the deck check counts. DECISION for the research task: the new data module is written from the corpus v1_2_0 and the existing document, so these two branches enter the new research set (no individual of the old files is dropped; the controller compares the sets), and the page may show them in the learn sections with the deck's slide 36 table (Current Python adds more) as the source of what the deck says about them. Operators normalise to empty in the deck check's concept count (not counted among the 19): the page may still present them." .
