ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Page_Build backlog:hasAuditNote "FINDING of the control of the chapter 5 deck (2026-10-25, executor disclosure checked): the logging examples use force=True because the browser's Python keeps logging state between runs; the line stepper uses sys.settrace and the breakpoint example swaps sys.breakpointhook; the executor did NOT run these two under the browser's Python (the controller re-ran all 20 examples only under Python 3.13.16). The page task must run every example of the manifest chapter_code_ch05_v1_0_0.json in the page, and if the stepper or the breakpoint example cannot run there, say it as the page test prints it (a skip is not a pass) and STOP and report: the manifest is the reference and is not edited. The code of the boxprint and stepper slides is set at 9.5 pt on the deck: the page shows it at the page's own size. The deck's resources slide has no video link (the video site answered 429 to the executor): the page's resources may carry one only if its link answers." .

