ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "CONTROLLER'S FACTS ON THE CHECK, read from sen0414_lineage_chapter_check_v1_1_0.py on 2026-10-25 (they decide whether your result is controlled): Research/ChNN runs (1) the RDODI gates (sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py NN) on the chapter's NEWEST research files and page ABox, and (2) the execution checks (sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py) on the NEWEST data module whose own __version__ (dots replaced by underscores) has its domain_tbox AND domain_abox files of the same version in 03-materials/chNN/rdodi. Today no such module exists for chapters 1 to 5: the check ends with 'no data module of chapter N has its ontology files' before the execution checks run (the gates also fail on Stage4.cov and Stage4.sub). So your new data module's __version__ must name a version whose domain_tbox and domain_abox files you build and commit in 03-materials/chNN/rdodi; the page ABox is the newest sen0414_chNN_page_abox_v*.ttl in 03-materials/chNN/page, and it must describe the NEW page (the page-build task of the chapter, Done and controlled). The check runs against the pinned ecosystem /home/claude/eco_pin/rdodi-ecosystem and Python 3.14. Run the chapter check Research/ChNN yourself before you report and paste its output." .
