ex:TK_Ret_Ch05_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "FINDING of the control of the chapter 5 deck (2026-10-25): the deck's logging examples use force=True, its stepper uses sys.settrace and its breakpoint example swaps sys.breakpointhook. The execution checks of the research run code under Python 3.14, so any example the research set describes must have the result CPython prints, never a result that was not measured; the page task decides whether the stepper and the breakpoint example run in the browser's Python." .

