    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 20 + time criticality 20 + risk reduction 3) / job size 3.5 h = 12.29. Business value 20 and time criticality 20 as chapter 1, the first of the owner's chapters, which it blocks; risk reduction 3 = the three examples measured failing; job size = three deck fixes of 1.0 h and the control of 0.5 h (estimates, G120). Scored on 2026-10-25T03:10:45 UTC (ex:CR2_ErrFirst): a repair outranks the work it blocks." .

