ex:Ev2_Ctl_page05 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 5 page (03-materials/ch05/page/sen0414_ch05_page_v9_90_0.html, commits e2adae9 and b43ac9c of the executor session SEN0414-I19-page-ch05): the controller's own serial runs under the shared lock - page test 9.37.0 through the runner v1_1_0 on the page: 90 of 90 widgets, 406 features passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped, the P2 run of the 20 chapter-code examples (including the stepper with sys.settrace and the breakpoint example) passes; page test 9.34.0 on the page 380 passed, 0 failed, and on the existing page v9_28_0 380 passed, 0 failed (not below); the chapter-code tab data equals the manifest chapter_code_ch05_v1_0_0.json (20 examples, order, names, code) which equals the deck 3.0.0's code boxes (M1 20 of 20); the three story pictures embedded as data URIs; the story layout probe at 1400x900 and 390x844 passes for all three stories (photo at most 385 px of 900 and 331 of 844, text inside the viewport) and the stories and chapter-code tabs were viewed on the controller's own screenshot; the chapter files of the page are committed and no committed file was modified since the planning commit 5136c8d. Disclosed by the executor and recorded: no video link on the resources (19 links answered HTTP 200 when it checked); the photo-size check was the executor's own (the controller measured it); a slip of the executor's: a glob delete of /tmp/sen0414_page_test_* matched nothing. Observation, not a failure: the Chapter examples (Lab/Playground) pane has 4 examples against the manifest's 20, the same relation as in the controlled pages of chapters 6 to 9. The chapter check covers Page only up to chapter 12 for other chapters and crashes here (fact 3 of ex:IA2_Iter19), so it was not run."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_Retrofit ;
