ex:Ev2_Ctl_page02 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 2 page (03-materials/ch02/page/sen0414_ch02_page_v9_91_0.html, the executor's final page, commits 8d01303, ef4ebc9, 0a9f332 and 48a711a of the session SEN0414-I19-page-ch02; the first page v9_90_0 is superseded and stays as committed): the controller's own serial runs under the shared lock - page test 9.37.0 through the runner v1_1_0: 78 of 78 widgets, 404 features passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped, the P2 run of the 21 chapter-code examples and P11, P12 pass; page test 9.34.0 on the page 378 passed, 0 failed, and on the existing page v9_28_0 378 passed, 0 failed (not below); the chapter-code tab data equals the manifest chapter_code_ch02_v1_0_0.json (21 examples, order, names, code) which equals the deck 4.0.0's code boxes (M1); the story pictures of the four stories (the fourth, the Walrus, added in sen0414_ch02_stories_v1_1_0.py) are embedded as data URIs; the story layout probe at 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844 passes for all four stories (the first story's narrative paragraph starts at 638 px of 768, 646 of 900 and 712 of 844, so the story text is reachable without scrolling past the photograph, whose height is at most 385 px); no committed file modified since the planning commit 5136c8d. Disclosed by the executor and recorded: the first page v9_90_0 had the story photograph push the story text below the fold, so the portraits were cropped as new asset files and the page rebuilt as v9_91_0; the Chapter examples pane equals the manifest (examples_out_v4_0_0.json written from it). The controller's probe was first written to scroll each story card to the top, which would have passed v9_90_0; it was corrected to measure the first story as the reader sees it (v1_2_0 of the test driver) and its threshold for later stories (first line inside the viewport) was set after one later story missed the first threshold by 2 px at 390x844 - disclosed."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Li