ex:Ev2_Ctl_research05 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 5 research set and page ABox (new files: document, domain TBox, ABox, SHACL, research v1_3_0 in 03-materials/ch05/rdodi and the page ABox sen0414_ch05_page_abox_v1_4_0.ttl, commits 45b7f5a, d913c05 and 9a2c3ee of the executor session SEN0414-I19-research-ch05, with the new data module, restore script, subset proof, page-ABox builder v1_1_10 and page-ABox compare tool): the controller's own chapter check Research/Ch05 ends PASS (the gates OVERALL PASS with Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src PASS on the new page ABox, HermiT consistent, 55 execution checks with 0 mismatches; Cross.B CANNOT_RUN with 0 hybrid chains, reported and NOT counted as a pass), Research/Ch06 to Research/Ch09 still PASS on the controller's own runs, the page file is byte-identical to its controlled commit e2adae9, and no committed file was modified since the planning commit 5136c8d; the controller's own comparison by local name (a script of its own, not the executor's): research files old against new - 268 and 268 individuals, 82 and 82 classes, 30 and 31 sources, 352 and 365 labels, none missing, and the 9 links missing are only version metadata (versionIRI, wasRevisionOf); page ABox old (v1_3_0, 135 individuals) against new (v1_4_0, 263) with the prefix s_ mapped - no individual and no predicate missing, exactly the 32 stated widget source links (to the whole document, now to the concept's own section) and the 14 stated reworded labels (layout names and visual-widget names) are missing. Disclosed by the executor and recorded: the old page-ABox builder v1_1_9 crashes on chapter 5 (empty discussion, static widgets without an I/O example, the visual kinds debugger, levels and unwind, the test name 9.36.0) and was fixed in the new file v1_1_10 - the crash affects the research tasks of chapters 1 to 4 (the briefs of the not yet started ones are re-issued, the started chapter 2 is told); one CO2 sentence reworded for Stage4.sub. Open points the executor named and the controller judges: (1) the page's ExceptionUnwinding text comes from the corpus and differs slightly from the repaired research text - an observation, the page is a controlled file and is not changed here; (2) the page panel IRIs still point to the document of ch05 and to older ontology versions while the manifest names the v1_1_0 files - an observation of the controlled page, not a gate failure (the gates pass), carried for the page's next version; (3) the builder crash - handled as above. The chapter check Research covers chapters 1 to 5."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch ;
