ed reworded ones (layout names, the steps-widget names of those seven concepts, visual-widget names). Disclosed by the executor and recorded: the page-ABox builder v1_1_10 stopped on chapter 2 data (lecture optional, visual kinds truthtable and branchflow) and was fixed in the new file v1_1_11; the executor did not capture its step-B commit SHA (the controller found it, 80b9a3b, with git log); the page ABox is versioned 9_91_0 so that the gate ranks it above v9_4_2 - the same ranking point applies to chapters 1, 3 and 4 and is folded into their briefs."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch ;
