ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Page_Build backlog:hasAuditNote "CONTROL NOT MET on the first rebuilt page (2026-10-25 UTC, the controller's own story-layout probe, log 08-tooling/control-iter19-logs/p37_ch01_storyfit3.log): the page sen0414_ch01_page_v9_91_0.html fails the rule 'the photograph is lower than the viewport and the story text begins within the first screen of the story' for the story LeibnizBinary at 1366x768 (portrait 467 px, text at 813 px of 768) and at 390x844 (portrait 409 px, text at 905 px of 844); the other stories and the executor's own measurements (first story, y 494 and 527) pass. The executor's 9.37.0 run 2 (408/0), 9.34.0 (382/0) and examples-pane file from manifest 1.1.0 are accepted as reported and will be re-measured by the controller on the final page. This is a REPAIR WITHIN THIS TASK (same as the chapter 7 deck precedent): the executor crops the Leibniz portrait as a new asset, rebuilds the page as a NEW version v9_92_0, checks every story at both sizes and reruns 9.37.0 and 9.34.0 serially; the task stays InProgress and is not Done until the controller's own runs on the final page pass. No new item and no change of dependencies: the open items are re-scored at the next completion." .
ex:TK_Ret_ErrFirst_Verify backlog:hasAuditNote "DISCLOSURE (2.224.0): the lineage agent edited committed files in place twice on 2026-10-25 UTC - (1) the control scripts sen0414_control_iter19_page_v1_0_0.py and sen0414_control_iter19_pagetests_v1_0_0.py (found by the coordinator by git, moved to v1_1_0, restored); (2) the committed pagetests v1_2_0 and page v1_3_0 scripts and the two logs p37_ch02_storyfit2.log and p37_ch05_storyfit2.log (rules of the story probe changed while the file was committed; restored, the changes are in the new files pagetests v1_3_0, page v1_4_0 and the log name storyfit3). The coordinator's rule holds: every new version of a control tool is a new file from the start. The story-layout rule has ONE form now (the narrative paragraph begins within the first screen of the story, the photograph is lower than the viewport); the pages of chapters 2 and 5 pass it on the controller's own runs (storyfit3 logs), so their records stand." .
ex:TK_Ret_Ch01_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "FOUND BY THE CHAPTER 2 RESEARCH TASK and controlled (2026-10-25 UTC): the page-ABox builder v1_1_10 of the chapter 5 task stopped on chapter 2 data (lecture optional, visual kinds truthtable and branchflow); the chapter 2 executor made the NEW file 08-tooling/sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_11.py; use the newest builder (v1_1_11 or a newer file of your own), never v1_1_9. RANKING BY VERSION: the page-ABox file must carry a version that the gates rank above the old page ABox of the chapter (the chapter 2 one is sen0414_ch02_page_abox_v9_91_0.ttl, above the old v9_4_2, so the chapter check reads it as the newest); the old ABoxes of chapters 1, 3 and 4 are v9_4_2, v1_5_0 and v1_5_0, so name a NEW one for the page you describe so that it ranks above them (read how the chapter check picks the newest file before you name it). The controller compares old and new files by local name with a script of its own (research files: no individual, class, label missing; every missing source or link needs a stated reason, header metadata included)." .
