ex:ObsR2C_Obj2_StdDecks a backlog:MetricObservation ; rdfs:label "Reading at the review that closed iteration 19"@en ;
    backlog:observesMetric ex:Met2_StdDecks ; backlog:observationFor ex:Obj2_StdDecks ; backlog:hasObservedValue "3"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:observedAt "2026-10-25T08:49:24"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:observedDuringCeremony ex:RC2_Iter_19 ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Measured in this run (2026-10-25T08:49:24 UTC), the metric as defined (decks of chapters 6, 7 and 8 that pass every element of the deck standard check): the deck standard check v1_0_0 and the overlap check v1_0_0 on the newest decks of chapters 6, 7 and 8: chapter 06 passes (SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)); chapter 07 passes (SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)); chapter 08 passes (SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)). The same checks on chapters 1 to 5 (beyond the metric's three chapters, read at the same time): 5 of 5 pass - chapter 01: SEN0414_Ch01_PythonBasics_3e_v4_1_0.pptx: SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); chapter 02: SEN0414_Ch02_FlowControl_3e_v4_0_0.pptx: SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); chapter 03: SEN0414_Ch03_Loops_3e_v5_1_0.pptx: SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); chapter 04: SEN0414_Ch04_Functions_3e_v3_1_0.pptx: SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); chapter 05: SEN0414_Ch05_Debugging_3e_v3_0_0.pptx: SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0; overlap RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)." .
