    backlog:hasScoreRationale "WSJF = (business value 20 + time criticality 10 + risk reduction 10) / job size 14.5 h = 2.76. Inputs from observable facts: job size is the sum of the story's task estimates in this register (Deck_Build 5.0 h, Deck_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Build 3.5 h, Research 4.0 h, Research_Verify 0.5 h, Page_Verify 1.0 h); time criticality 10 = place 11 in the owner's order of chapters of Iteration 20 (20 = chapter 10, 5 = chapter 25); risk reduction 10 = the deck-standard elements measured failing (7) + 2 for Stage 4 never run (no page ABox) + 1 where the chapter check fails on the execution checks (measured 2026-10-25 UTC). Scored on 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC at the planning of Iteration 20 (ex:CR2_Iter20); the earlier planned-and-unscored state is history." .
ex:ST_Plan_Retrofit_Ch20 backlog:hasAuditNote "PLANNED INTO ITERATION 20 on 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter20, planning ceremony ex:PC2_Iter_20): Ready, scored, decomposed into six tasks (deck build, deck verify, page build, research set and page ABox, research verify, page verify). CHAPTER 20 (Email, Texts and Push Notifications) as it stands (measured 2026-10-25 UTC by the lineage agent): research 03-materials/ch20/rdodi (document 1_0_2, domain TBox 1_0_2, ABox 1_0_2, SHACL 1_0_2, research 1_0_2); data module sen0414_ch20_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py; corpus sen0414_ch20_corpus_base_v1_0_0.py; stories sen0414_ch20_stories_v1_0_0.py; the earlier deck is sen0414_ch20_deck_v1_0_1.pptx (builder deck_build_v1_0_1.py) - it lives in 08-tooling/ch20-deck/, NOT in 03-materials, and stays there; newest page sen0414_ch20_page_v9_35_0.html; page ABox: NONE (the first page ABox of this chapter is built by the research task); chapter-code manifest: none. The deck standard check v1_0_0 on the earlier deck prints 7 failing elements (D1,D2,D3,D4,D11,D5,D7; M1 and D10 not measured) and the overlap check ends CLEAN (0 findings). The chapter check Research/Ch20 ends FAIL: the gates end OVERALL: PASS, Stage 4 is not run (no page ABox exists), Cross.B CANNOT_RUN; the execution checks of the data module end exit 1 with 3 MISMATCH line(s) (log 08-tooling/control-iter20-logs/pre_Research_Ch20.log: read it first - the claims that print a mismatch here depend on what is installed on this machine or on a service). GAPS SAID OPENLY: (a) the metrics Met2_StdDecks and Met2_StdPages count the decks and pages of chapters 6, 7 and 8 (target 3) and read 3 and 3; the retrofit of chapters 10 to 25 moves no number of them, as that of chapters 1 to 5 did not (ex:Finding2_Iter19_MetricScope); widening them is the Owner's decision and no rebaseline is written; the review of Iteration 20 reports the chapters as readings in the method text. (b) Cross.B of the research gates cannot run in any chapter (0 hybrid chains); the research criterion of the retrofit says: Cross.B must not FAIL, CANNOT_RUN is reported and is not a pass; the pilot of ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB models the chains in ONE chapter (chapter 6); carrying the model to the other 24 chapters is a further item, not part of this iteration. (c) The execution checks of eleven chapters fail on this machine for reasons of the environment (installed packages, services, timing): a claim is made reproducible by an isolated environment the data module builds itself, or it is reported as printed (FAIL) and the criterion is NOT MET; no claim is weakened to pass, and a skip is not a pass. (d) The end of Iter_20 is the proposed end of seven days (G9); a rebaseline is an owner decision. 16 chapters at 14.5 h are 232 h, and the pilot 8.5 h: with at most three executors at once and the page tests serial on two cores the plan does not promise that all sixteen chapters finish inside it; a chapter that is not Done at the review is said to be not Done and is carried by the change route, not hidden. (e) The Deck and Page cases of the chapter check were not run for chapters 10 to 25. No executor has started; work begun is recorded at the real start of each executor session." .

ex:TK_Ret_Ch21_Deck_Build a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Rebuild the deck of chapter 21 (Graphs and Images) against the deck standard and give it its chapter-code manifest"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "TK_Ret_Ch21_Deck_Build" ; backlog:hasTitle "Rebuild the deck of chapter 21 (Graphs and Images) against the deck standard and give it its chapter-code manifest" ;
