un beside a browser test of yours; a timing-sensitive check can fail under load - say so, rerun on a quiet machine, keep the failing log. (4) Everything you cite in your report is a commit you made and a file that exists; the controller re-runs every claim, so a report that says more than the files show is NOT MET." .

