    backlog:hasTransitionNote "Withdrawn on 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC by the change route ex:CR2_Iter20: the story waited for a measurement ('the list of chapters still lacking research, deck or page is measured when the retrofits finish'). Measured 2026-10-25: the repository holds research files (03-materials/chNN/rdodi), a deck (03-materials/chNN or 08-tooling/chNN-deck) and a page (03-materials/chNN/page) for each of the 25 chapters of the course (the 3rd edition's 24 chapters and the threads chapter 25 of the 2nd edition); no chapter lacks one of the three, so there is nothing to build from scratch. The standard-conformance of chapters 10 to 25 is the work of the 16 retrofit stories. If a chapter outside these 25 is named, or one is found lacking, a new story is made by the change route. Not a waiver: the work the story named is measured empty." .

