ex:AC2F_Retrofit backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter20): the criterion is planned into Iteration 20 for chapters 10 to 25 on the same terms as for chapters 1 to 5 (the deck standard check, the deck overlap check, the page test 9.37.0 and 9.34.0 under the runner v1_1_0; the chapter-code manifest 03-materials/chNN/page/chapter_code_chNN_v1_0_0.json equals the deck's code boxes, text and order; the first-line error scan of the manifest passes; the story-layout rule holds for every story at 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844); the new deck of a chapter 10 to 25 goes to 03-materials/chNN (the earlier deck stays in 08-tooling/chNN-deck); the research set is the criterion ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch20; no committed file is edited." .

ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch20 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The research set and the first page ABox of a retrofitted chapter 10 to 25 pass the chapter check Research on the new page"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given the research set of chapter N as it stands (documents, domain TBox, ABox, SHACL and research files; the chapter check Research/ChNN ends PASS or FAIL on the execution checks of the data module; NO page ABox exists, so Stage 4 and Cross.B have never run for the chapter) and the NEW page of the chapter (the page-build task of the same chapter, Done and controlled), when (A) where the chapter check ends FAIL on the execution checks (or on a gate), a NEW data module 08-tooling/sen0414_chNN_rdodi_data_vX_Y_Z.py is written from the chapter corpus and the existing research files so that every claim reproduces - a claim that depends on an installed package or a service is made reproducible by an isolated environment the data module builds itself, or it is reported as printed; no claim is weakened - and the chapter files are rebuilt from it by the generic builder (sen0414_rdodi_build_v1_2_0.py) as NEW versioned files in 03-materials/chNN/rdodi; where the chapter check ends PASS the research files are NOT rebuilt (nothing is changed for its own sake), and (B) the page-ABox builder v1_1_13 (08-tooling/sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_13.py; a NEW version file if it stops on a visual kind it does not know - v1_1_11 stopped on 'names', v1_1_12 on 'floatbits') builds the page ABox 03-materials/chNN/page/sen0414_chNN_page_abox_v9_95_0.ttl that describes the NEW page (its menus, tabs, panels, widgets and chapter-code examples as they are in that page), then ALL of: (1) every new file is new and every committed file (the older research files, the deck, the page, the manifest, the builders) is byte-identical; (2) every typed individual of the new page ABox (and of any new research ABox) has a label, a definition and a source where the gates ask for them, and content of at least five words that is substantive by the gate, written from the book's chapter, the deck, the page and the existing content; where research files are rebuilt, the set of individuals, classes, links and sources of the old files is a subset of the new files' or each missing one has a stated reason (the controller compares the sets); (3) the chapter check Research/ChNN ends exit 0 with 'RESULT Research/ChNN: PASS': the gates 'OVERALL: PASS' with Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src passing on the NEW page ABox, HermiT consistent, the execution checks with 0 mismatches ON THE CONTROLLER'S MACHINE; Cross.B must not FAIL; it reports CANNOT_RUN (0 hybrid chains) and is reported openly as such and NOT counted as a pass (the pilot ex:ST_Plan_Gap_CrossB models the chains in one chapter); (4) the deck, the page and the manifest of the chapter are not changed (the page file keeps its SHA-256) and the page test 9.37.0 still ends exit 0 on the page; (5) the chapter checks Research/Ch01 to Research/Ch09 and the Research checks of the chapters retrofitted before still end PASS (a signal-timing claim may fail under load: report it, do not work around it); no committed file is edited; results as printed, measured by the controller by its own re-runs." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_RdodiGates, ex:TS2_ChapterCheck, ex:TS2_PageAboxBuild13 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "chapter check v1_1_0; RDODI gates v1_1_1; RDODI checks v1_2_0; generic builder v1_2_0; page-ABox builder v1_1_13 (or a newer new-file version); the page test 9.37.0; Python 3.14, HermiT" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2R6_Passes, ex:TC2R6_NotClaimed, ex:TC2R6B_PageAbox .
ex:TS2_PageAboxBuild13 a backlog:ToolScript ; rdfs:label "page-ABox builder v1_1_13 (new file over v1_1_12; knows the visual kinds names and floatbits)"@en ; backlog:scriptFileName "sen0414_page_abox_build_v1_1_13.py" ; backlog:acceptsGraphPath false .
ex:AC2F_CrossB backlog:hasAuditNote "RESTATED 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter20): the criterion is met for the PILOT chapter 6 only (the chapter's chains are modelled in new ABox files, Cross.B prints a number of chains above zero and none broken); the other 24 chapters stay CANNOT_RUN and are said so; the decision what a hybrid chain of this course is is taken from the gate's own definition by the controller (task TK_Gap_CrossB_Spec_Verify). Not a waiver: the scope is stated, not reduced silently." .
ex:Excl2_NoRebuild rdfs:comment "Lifted on 2026-10-25T09:46:42 UTC (ex:CR2_Iter20) for chapters 10 to 25, ONLY for the NEW files of their decks, chapter-code manifests, pages, research sets, data modules and page ABoxes (the retrofit of Iteration 20), and for the NEW chapter 6 ABox files of the Cross.B pilot: no existing deck, research run, page or page ABox of these chapters is changed."@en .
