x:TK_Ret_Ch21_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch22_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch23_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch24_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Deck_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Deck_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Page_Build, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Research, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Research_Verify, ex:TK_Ret_Ch25_Page_Verify, ex:TK_Gap_CrossB_Spec, ex:TK_Gap_CrossB_Spec_Verify, ex:TK_Gap_CrossB_Build, ex:TK_Gap_CrossB_Build_Verify ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Direction of the course coordinator, 2026-10-25, recorded as relayed: the Iteration 19 close is accepted; run the Iteration 20 change route now without waiting for the owner: check the stories against the verified gaps, change request and impact assessment, re-rank in the owner's order, generate the briefs from the current generator with the lessons of Iteration 19 folded in (new tool files from the start, the page-ABox builder v1_1_13, the page-ABox version above the old one, the story-layout probe on every story, the first-line error scan on manifests, the executor's own probe as strict as the controller's); plan the batches so that at most three executors run at once (two cores; the serial page-test lock was the bottleneck of Iteration 19; decks and research in parallel, page tests the only serial part). The owner's decision of Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul (13:06 UTC) (ex:CR2_Priority3), recorded as relayed, is the release: after chapters 7, 8 and 9, return to ALL chapters (chapters 1 to 5 are done and controlled), and after that build all remaining chapters. The boundary does not move outward in deliverables; the stories were admitted by the owner's decision, these are their tasks." .
ex:CR2_Iter20 rdfs:comment "Disposition set to Accepted on 2026-10-25 in the version that records the ScopeChange ex:SC2_Iter20; it was Pending before. The release is the owner's decision of 2026-10-23 (ex:CR2_Priority3) and the coordinator's direction; the owner is not waited for."@en .

