ex:Ev2_Ctl_deck11 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 11 deck (03-materials/ch11/SEN0414_Ch11_OrganizingFiles_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 41 slides, 19 examples, 9 native charts, 4 stories, with the chapter-code manifest 03-materials/ch11/page/chapter_code_ch11_v1_0_0.json; commits 82b5409 and 578473d of the executor session SEN0414-I20-deck-ch11; the earlier deck 08-tooling/ch11-deck/sen0414_ch11_deck_v1_0_0.pptx stays as committed): the controller's own re-runs - the deck standard check v1_0_0 prints SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 including M1 (the manifest equals the deck's code boxes, text and order, 19 of 19; the earlier deck failed 7 elements), the overlap check v1_0_0 ends CLEAN (0 findings), the first-line error scan of the manifest ends PASS (0 of 19), the 19 examples run now under Python 3.13.16 in a fresh interpreter print exactly the recorded result, the 4 story pictures cover the 4 story slides with a provenance record, no committed file of the chapter is modified since the register commit that planned Iteration 20 (16 files added), everything is committed; the controller rendered all 41 slides to images and read a selection (title, analogy table, a divider, the send2trash comparison table, the walk with its chart and table, the archive diagram, the ZIP project with its diagram and chart, the resources slide): legible, numbered, explanation beside each listing. Disclosures of the executor, judged: no free portraits exist for Katz, Gailly and Daley, so the stories use a PKZIP floppy picture, Mark Adler, a Susan Kare frame and von Neumann with the licences recorded - accepted (real pictures with recorded licences; the criterion asks for a real picture, not a portrait of each person); code boxes that continue a function start with the comment line '# continued', which is part of the manifest code and runs - accepted, it is valid Python and the page shows the same text; the YouTube link answered 429 to the executor's check and the oEmbed answer shows the video exists - a live-link item to re-check, not a gate failure. The executor also ran Research/Ch11 (PASS, 72 checks); that belongs to the research task and is controlled there. The page test and the story probe belong to the page task."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_Retrofit ;
