ex:TK_Ret_Ch10_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "Controlled by the lineage agent on 2026-10-25T13:19:08 UTC: the chapter 10 research and its first page ABox (commit e04dafb of the executor session SEN0414-I20-research-ch10; 03-materials/ch10/page/sen0414_ch10_page_abox_v9_95_0.ttl describing the page v9_95_0; the research files were not rebuilt because the check passed before): the controller's own re-runs with sen0414_control_iter20_research_v1_0_0.py - the chapter check Research/Ch10 run now on the controller's machine ends RESULT Research/Ch10 PASS (gates OVERALL PASS, Stage4.A, B, cov, sub, src PASS on the new page ABox, HermiT consistent, 0 mismatches), Cross.B reports CANNOT_RUN (0 hybrid chains) and is NOT counted as a pass (tracked by the Cross.B pilot), the page v9_95_0 is unmodified since the page task added it, no committed file of the chapter is modified (30 files added since the Iter_20 base), everything is committed; the pre-retrofit check log shows PASS, so no rebuild was needed. Disclosures of the executor, judged: three Stage4.B warnings not investigated - the same three advisory warnings (L-66) as the accepted chapter 1 page ABox, so accepted as advisory; the page test and earlier chapter checks were not re-run by the executor - they belong to the page task, which the controller ran; 39 of 82 domain-ABox expression individuals appear in the page ABox and the other 43 are research claims - accepted, the criterion asks for the page's own widgets and examples. Not repeated by the controller: the executor's own compare tool (sen0414_ch10_page_abox_compare_v1_0_0.py) and its python3.13 and 3.14 double run; the counts of 59 widgets and 18 examples are the executor's reading, the 18 examples match the manifest by the executor's compare.. Evidence ex:Ev2_Ctl_research10, verified by backlog_evidence_bridge_v1_1_0." .
