ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Page_Build backlog:hasAuditNote "From the controller's control of the chapter 15 deck (2.254.0): the deck has FIVE stories (the sixth, EzsheetsRelease2019, has no picture of Al Sweigart or EZSheets); the page shows the same five stories so deck and page agree. The examples need the stand-in module google_standin (03-materials/ch15/assets/google_standin_v1_0_0.py, with its speed patch and uninstall()) and the 14 wheels listed in the manifest's library block (hashes recorded); the page must install and unpack them before the first example, and the page test must run the examples through that (the page-data builder v2.25.0 reads only 'examples': check it and use a new file if it must also read the 'library' block). Real pictures only; the named person where one is reachable." .
ex:TK_Ret_Ch15_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "From the controller's control of the chapter 15 deck: the chapter check Research/Ch15 failed for the executor on the execution checks (No module named ezsheets under the system Python). The claims that need ezsheets must be made reproducible by an environment the data module builds itself (the wheels are in 03-materials/ch15/assets, with recorded hashes), or reported as printed; no claim is weakened. The stories module is v1_0_0 and holds six stories, the deck five." .

