ex:Ev2_Ctl_page11 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 11 page (03-materials/ch11/page/sen0414_ch11_page_v9_96_0.html, the repair of the NOT MET v9_95_0 recorded in 2.250.0; commits 1073cf6, 92e9dca and 1256451 of the executor session SEN0414-I20-page-ch11; template 9.52.2, builder 4.18.1, page-data builder 2.25.0; the Adler photograph cropped to a 400x300 landscape head-and-shoulders asset photo_adler_crop.jpg with the original unchanged; v9_95_0 and the earlier page v9_28_0 stay as committed): the controller's own serial runs under the shared lock with the control scripts sen0414_control_iter20_page_v1_1_0.py and sen0414_control_iter20_pagetests_v1_1_0.py (new files: the new page is the newest page above v9_95_0) - the story-layout probe on EVERY story at 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844: 12 of 12 PASS (story 2 at 390x844 now photo 249 of 844, first text 664; it failed at 442 and 857 on v9_95_0); page test 9.37.0 on v9_96_0: 406 features passed, 0 failed, widgets 64 and 64, P2 examples, P11 and P12 pass, none skipped; page test 9.34.0 on v9_96_0: 380 passed, 0 failed; on the earlier page v9_28_0: 378 passed, 0 failed (widgets not below, none skipped); the chapter-code tab data equals the manifest (19 of 19, order, names, code), which equals the deck's code boxes (M1 19 of 19); the 4 stories and their 4 pictures are embedded; nothing committed is modified (50 files added since the planning commit); everything is committed. TOOL DEFECT, said openly: the chapter check Page/ChNN of the committed tool sen0414_lineage_chapter_check_v1_0_0.py and v1_1_0.py calls the page-test runner v1_0_0, whose default page is v9_28_0, so Page/ChNN has always tested the EARLIER page and says nothing about a new page. The executor found it on chapter 11 (its Page/Ch11 PASS tested v9_28_0, and so did the one for v9_95_0). What it affected: the control of the chapter 10 page (register 2.242.0) cited 'Page/Ch10 run by the controller: PASS' - that run tested the old page v9_28_0; the evidence that the chapter 10 page v9_95_0 passes rests on the controller's direct runs of 9.37.0 and 9.34.0 on v9_95_0 (402 and 376 features), which were recorded, so the verdict stands, but the label's mention of Page/Ch10 as a test of the new page was wrong and is corrected here; the page controls of chapters 1 to 5 (Iter_19) never used Page/ChNN and ran the page tests directly on the new page; chapters 6 to 9 (Iter_18) recorded the same limit in their own control scripts (the chapter check calls runner v1_0_0 and runs the existing page v9_28_0 only). Repair: a NEW tool sen0414_lineage_chapter_check_v1_2_0.py runs the runner v1_1_0 with page test 9.37.0 on the NEWEST page file of the chapter and prints 'PAGE TESTED: v9_96_0 ...' as its first line; the controller ran it under the lock: RESULT Page/Ch11: PASS, PAGE TESTED v9_96_0, 406 features, 0 failed (log pagechk_Page_Ch11.log). The old versions stay as committed. Disclosures of the executor, judged: the first 9.34.0 attempt of the executor timed out waiting for the lock (its own 570 s timeout) and the empty log was overwritten, the second run is the one reported - accepted, the controller's own runs are the evidence; the page data of v9_95_0 and v9_96_0 differ only in the Adler image, size, credit and file name - accepted; the YouTube link z0gguhEmWiY answered 200 - accepted; the stories wording of v1_0_1 (Multics, zlib) is used by the page and the research task has been told (2.250.0)."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_Retrofit ;
    backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "page11" ; backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/sen0414_control_iter20_page_v1_1_0.py" ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "python3 08-tooling/sen0414_control_iter20_page_v1_1_0.py page11 exited 0" ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "backlog_evidence_bridge_v1_1_0 with the course repository as workspace" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-26T05:25:18"^^xsd:dateTime .
