ex:Ev2_Ctl_deck16 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 16 deck v2_0_1 (03-materials/ch16/SEN0414_Ch16_SQLiteDatabases_3e_v2_0_1.pptx, 54 slides, 25 examples, 6 stories, with the chapter-code manifest 03-materials/ch16/page/chapter_code_ch16_v1_0_1.json; the repair inside the task of the NOT MET v2_0_0 recorded in 2.257.0; commits 13252ac, 83463d5 and 0918c8f of the executor session SEN0414-I20-deck-ch16; v2_0_0 and the earlier deck 08-tooling/ch16-deck/sen0414_ch16_deck_v1_0_0.pptx stay as committed): the controller's own re-runs with the control script sen0414_control_iter20_deck_v1_4_0.py (the first run of v1_3_0 on this chapter stopped because the manifest has a library block without a file, so a new file v1_4_0 runs such a manifest one example at a time) - the deck standard check prints SUMMARY PASS=13 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 including M1 (25 of 25), the overlap check ends CLEAN, the first-line error scan ends PASS, the 25 examples run now in a fresh interpreter (Python 3.13.16) print exactly the recorded result, no committed file of the chapter is modified (39 files added since the planning commit), everything is committed, the story pictures (7 files, one replaced) cover the 6 story slides with a licence record in story_images_v2_0_0.json and story_images_v2_0_1.json; Pyodide 0.28.2 (the controller's own installation, the executor's runner on the v1_0_1 manifest): Python 3.13.2, SQLite 3.39.0, 25 examples PASS (log pyodide_ch16_v201.log); the 17 hyperlinks answered 200 (one IBM page answered nothing to a first try and 200 to the second, a transient). THE REPAIR: slide 25 now shows a real portrait of Randall Munroe himself (Wikimedia Commons, Randall Munroe 2016, re:publica from Germany, CC BY 2.0, 2397x2645 stored at 1449x1600); the controller looked at the rendered slide: the picture is a portrait of a man speaking, the caption says 'Randall Munroe, author of xkcd, 2016. Photo: re:publica, CC BY 2.0, Wikimedia Commons', and the record names the same artist, licence and file page; that the man in the picture is Munroe rests on the Commons file title and its description, the controller did not verify the face and states that. The other five stories were read in the first control and are honest (Hipp, van Rossum, the SQLite banner, Jim Gray named on the slide as the person the two researchers built on, Codd, 150 px wide and soft). Disclosures of the executor, judged: the Deck and Page cases of the chapter check were not run - the Deck case of the committed chapter check exists only for the build scripts of chapters 7 to 12 and does not apply to this chapter, so it is not run and the controller's own checks above stand in its place; two aborted runs left no result - accepted, the controller's runs are the evidence; the executor used another session's pyodide npm folder read-only - noted, the controller used its own installation; Research/Ch16 PASS printed by the executor - belongs to the research task and is controlled there. Open owner content decision unchanged: the Codd portrait is small. The page test and story probe belong to the page task."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_Retrofit ;
