2.0, Wikimedia Commons', and the record names the same artist, licence and file page; that the man in the picture is Munroe rests on the Commons file title and its description, the controller did not verify the face and states that. The other five stories were read in the first control and are honest (Hipp, van Rossum, the SQLite banner, Jim Gray named on the slide as the person the two researchers built on, Codd, 150 px wide and soft). Disclosures of the executor, judged: the Deck and Page cases of the chapter check were not run - the Deck case of the committed chapter check exists only for the build scripts of chapters 7 to 12 and does not apply to this chapter, so it is not run and the controller's own checks above stand in its place; two aborted runs left no result - accepted, the controller's runs are the evidence; the executor used another session's pyodide npm folder read-only - noted, the controller used its own installation; Research/Ch16 PASS printed by the executor - belongs to the research task and is controlled there. Open owner content decision unchanged: the Codd portrait is small. The page test and story probe belong to the page task.. Evidence ex:Ev2_Ctl_deck16, verified by backlog_evidence_bridge_v1_1_0." .
