ex:Ev2_Ctl_research11 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Control by the lineage agent: the chapter 11 research and its first page ABox (commit 576b617 of the executor session SEN0414-I20-research-ch11; 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0414_ch11_page_abox_v9_96_0.ttl describing the controlled page v9_96_0; the research files were not rebuilt because the check passed before): the controller's own re-runs with sen0414_control_iter20_research_v1_1_0.py (a new file: the page and the ABox are those of the newest page version of the chapter) - the chapter check Research/Ch11 run now on the controller's machine ends RESULT Research/Ch11: PASS (gates OVERALL PASS, Stage4.A, B, cov, sub, src PASS on the new page ABox, HermiT consistent, 0 mismatches), Cross.B reports CANNOT_RUN (0 hybrid chains) and is NOT counted as a pass (tracked by the Cross.B pilot), the page v9_96_0 is unmodified since the page task added it, no committed file of the chapter is modified (51 files added since the planning commit), everything is committed. THE NAME OF THE ABox, judged: the brief said v9_95_0, the executor named the ABox for the page it describes, v9_96_0, because the controlled page of chapter 11 is v9_96_0 (v9_95_0 failed the story-layout rule and is superseded); an ABox named v9_95_0 would describe a page it does not describe - accepted, the name follows the page. Criterion 4 (the page unchanged): the executor did not re-run page test 9.37.0 because the page files are hash-unchanged; the controller's own runs of 9.37.0 (406 features, 0 failed), 9.34.0 (380) and the story probe (12 of 12) on v9_96_0 are recorded in register 2.256.0 and the page file is byte-identical to that controlled commit, so the criterion is met by the controller's runs, not by hashes alone. Disclosures of the executor, judged: three Stage4.B advisory warnings, the same three (L-66) as in the accepted chapters 1 and 10 - accepted; Research/Ch01 to Ch10 still PASS after the executor's run - noted, not repeated by the controller. A point the controller states openly: the commit 576b617 is dated 06:09:29 UTC, one and a half minutes after the start 06:08 given by the coordinator for this task (a first instant, 05:58, was corrected to 06:08 before anything was committed); the work reported (a page ABox of 930 lines, compare tool and nine chapter-check runs) cannot have been done in that time, so the recorded start instant is probably late; the register keeps the instant given, and this is said here and told to the coordinator, who can give the real start by the change route if it is known."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ; backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC2F_RetrofitResearch20 ;
