ex:TK_Ret_Ch11_Research backlog:hasAuditNote "CORRECTION of the start instant, made on 2026-10-26T09:00:50 UTC: the coordinator gave 2026-10-26T06:08 and had read the clock at 06:07 UTC just before launching the executor (a first instant, 05:58, was also wrong), so the real start is 2026-10-26T06:07:00. The earlier versions 2.260.0 to 2.262.0 stay as committed and carry 06:08; this version carries 06:07 on the task, its start transition and its brief instance. The commit 576b617 of the executor is dated 06:09:29 UTC, 2.5 minutes after the corrected start, which is still short for the work reported (a page ABox of 930 lines, a compare tool and nine chapter-check runs): the controller notes it and does not rule on it; the dates of the commits are the executor's machine clock." .

